# heart deploy secrets, read by `make new-release`.
#
# Copy this file to `heart/.env` and fill in the tokens. `heart/.env` is gitignored.
# `make new-release RELEASE=<v>` reads these and stores them as encrypted
# Pulumi stack secrets (digitalocean:token, heart:influx-token), so you no
# longer set the two `pulumi config set --secret` values by hand after
# creating a stack. Both are required; the target fails if either is missing.
#
#   DIGITALOCEAN_TOKEN  DigitalOcean API token used to provision the droplets.
#   INFLUX_TOKEN        InfluxDB token for metrics shipping (heart:influx-token).

DIGITALOCEAN_TOKEN=
INFLUX_TOKEN=
